{"id":"vod_sn_35608","vodId":"35608","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Fantasista Doll","name_cn":"Fantasista Doll","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/aaa88d216d74ca74537afc9615c08148.jpg"},"summary":"鹈野涡芽（大桥彩香 配音）是一名平凡的十五岁少女，一天，涡芽搭乘电车外出，在车上遇见了一个怪人，整个人不由分说的塞给了涡芽一叠名为“Fantasista Doll”的卡片。涡芽在懵懵懂懂之中打开了卡片，让她没有想到的是，五名活泼可爱的少女出现在了她的面前，自己成为了她们的主人。　　沉着靠谱深得同伴们信赖的莎莎萝（津田美波 配音）、身形娇小可爱有些傲娇的卡蒂亚（徳井青空 配音）、成熟知性总是想着守护大家的玛德蕾娜（大原沙耶香 配音）、沉默寡言毫无存在感的小明（长谷川明子 配音）和拥有着和外表毫不相称的强大实力的希梅吉（赤崎千夏 配音），和这五名少女一起，涡芽被卷入了激烈的战斗之中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c73VWzrStU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g1MppZ0amm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RFFYRYVspW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pQjAdcSrxu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/apUf5vCPDM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fnTz8njkcG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/j1PYpkPByF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5Q7Y7kePXn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h6CeWkLM0f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xxd46vHdVZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D44dGQxPKp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FSjqA35tmH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.180Z"}